{"data":{"body":"[P1] Keep constructor mock implementations constructible\n\n`S3Exporter` invokes both mocks with `new`. Vitest requires constructible implementations, so replacing these functions with arrows causes constructor errors before the exporter assertions run. The same regression appears across the changed telemetry-core and telemetry-exporter tests. Restore function or class implementations for the constructor mocks, using targeted `useArrowFunction` suppressions where necessary.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs8AAAABDj97yg","finding_digest":"a79708864684368ed86fc7cd61ca41c72a626cbdf0a4e6654e3f13ebe4b9c8be","finding_id":"arf_v1_u6lqrbsgqq3i5wdpy7gwdssby4","finding_key":"telemetry-tests::aws-sdk-constructor-mocks::constructible-implementations","identity_key":"telemetry-tests::aws-sdk-constructor-mocks::constructible-implementations","line":6,"observation_digest":"4d491d7659c583e908745e075527e8508ef80232af845380fced8955a27a7687","observation_id":"aro_v1_jver25szywb6scdulydvkj7ikc","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-telemetry-exporter/src/exporters/s3-exporter.test.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_u6lqrbsgqq3i5wdpy7gwdssby4","published_at":"2026-11-11T04:28:54Z","review_id":"arr_v1_czr743zhw4ernpp6qduc4xiwq5","reviewed_base_sha":"644140a687f1cb34b30ed581ebd147fbe5cade5e","reviewed_head_sha":"4cf2c5ad66b7fdc3babbd05922f09c3ae6502b9f","reviewer":"codex","start_line":5,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":1218},"record_id":"art_v1_lwpk272c3mc73vedx6krsbpp6t","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-11-11T04:28:54Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
